WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.070
Recurring visits: weekly, fortnightly and monthly recurring visits; each round's jobs are created automatically.

2
00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:13.900
From a job, click "Make recurring" and choose the frequency.

3
00:00:14.451 --> 00:00:19.200
See each plan's "Next visit"; to skip once, "Skip next".

4
00:00:19.749 --> 00:00:27.370
To pause, "Pause"; to continue, "Resume"; ending a plan cancels future visits.

5
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.980
Agree with the customer before ending a plan; future visits are cancelled.
